      "updated": 1706659200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "说明：",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a16",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1000000017,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2000000017,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1706659200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "说明：用户以中文自然语言描述任务，\n例如“画一张流程图…”，作为整个\n工作流的输入起点。",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 370,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a17",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1000000018,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2000000018,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1706659200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "说明：createAgent 组装模型、工具与\n中间件，生成可流式调用的 Agent\n实例，是工作流的核心容器。",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a18",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1000000019,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2000000019,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1706659200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "说明：skills 中间件按需读取\nSKILL.md，为模型提供技能能力\n（如 excalidraw 绘图）。",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 710,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a19",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1000000020,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2000000020,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1706659200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "说明：filesystem 中间件通过\nLocalShellBackend 读写文件，\n将生成的 .excalidraw 保存到磁盘。",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 880,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a20",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1000000021,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2000000021,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1706659200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "说明：模型流式输出最终回复，\n同时将图表文件写入\nsrc/deepagents/output/ 目录。",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },

